1
00:00:01,270 --> 00:00:02,250
This is Inky.

2
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:03,950
You tell it a job once.

3
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:06,050
It researches, learns the sites,

4
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:08,750
builds its own workflow
and keeps it running.

5
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,350
You just decide.

6
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:14,400
I didn't set anything up or write any code.

7
00:00:14,490 --> 00:00:19,200
I just said: €200,000,
a flat to rent out abroad.

8
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:22,600
It asked what it couldn't guess,
then wrote the plan.

9
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:28,850
Through Apify it read almost 18,000
listings in Porto, Bari and Łódź.

10
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:34,750
An open model wrote rules, the data
tested them, and 46 homes passed.

11
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:40,600
Tecnocasa had no scraper,
so Inky borrowed my screen once.

12
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:44,750
It found the data feed and
published its own Apify actor.

13
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:50,350
Then eight windows with no AI
read 96 flats in 20 seconds.

14
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:54,700
A clicking AI agent got 15, for 13 cents.

15
00:00:56,260 --> 00:01:00,150
Inky built this n8n workflow itself.

16
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:04,750
Every 15 minutes, five Apify
scrapers feed plain code.

17
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:09,500
A run costs about 20 cents,
and makes zero AI calls.

18
00:01:10,260 --> 00:01:13,050
To test it, I broke one step on purpose.

19
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:18,050
n8n caught it, and the open model
fixed the input in 7 seconds,

20
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,400
published the fix and ran
it again. Then it told me.

21
00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:24,400
Changing it takes one sentence:

22
00:01:24,540 --> 00:01:26,450
“only places with the euro.”

23
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:29,100
46 homes become 14.

24
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:33,850
I approve one on Telegram, and the
email waits in Gmail as a draft.

25
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:35,500
Inky never sends.

26
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:40,000
Sharing takes one sentence too.

27
00:01:40,290 --> 00:01:43,350
Inky writes what it does
and leaves my budget out.

28
00:01:43,810 --> 00:01:46,200
My sister changes it by describing it.

29
00:01:46,450 --> 00:01:48,500
Or start from someone else's agent,

30
00:01:48,610 --> 00:01:52,300
for prices, invoices,
whatever you check by hand.

31
00:01:53,260 --> 00:01:55,400
That's Inky. Tell it once.

32
00:01:55,630 --> 00:01:58,800
It checks every 15 minutes,
and you only decide.
